sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant PLO as ProcessLifecycleOwner
    participant Obs as AppLifecycleObserver
    participant Analytics as AnalyticsBatcher (Ch 14)
    participant WS as WebSocket (Ch 63)

    User->>PLO: leaves app (background)
    PLO->>Obs: ON_STOP
    Obs->>Analytics: flush batched events
    Obs->>WS: pause/disconnect
    User->>PLO: returns (foreground)
    PLO->>Obs: ON_START
    Obs->>WS: reconnect
    Obs->>Analytics: resume
